{"2468410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Just One More Pet", "steam_appid": 2468410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Just One More Pet</strong>, your goal is simple: make your cat happy nine times in a row. The problem? You start with only a 25% chance of success. Every pet is a gamble. One unhappy reaction resets your streak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet your cat.</strong>  <br>He might be happy… or he might not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468410/extras/a2952e5579f52f6eb07ae6a8f011aa45.poster.avif?t=1783463614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468410/extras/a2952e5579f52f6eb07ae6a8f011aa45.webm?t=1783463614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468410/extras/a2952e5579f52f6eb07ae6a8f011aa45.mp4?t=1783463614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect nostalgic items.</strong>  <br>Some please the cat. Some are just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468410/extras/87a44c69a9e1ecd893b7683b7c8e15ac.poster.avif?t=1783463614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468410/extras/87a44c69a9e1ecd893b7683b7c8e15ac.webm?t=1783463614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468410/extras/87a44c69a9e1ecd893b7683b7c8e15ac.mp4?t=1783463614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragra